Cell[BoxData["\<\"borsalino3 is valid basis. The definitions of the basis \
will be saved in \\\"Bases/borsalino3\\\" directory.\\n    Ds[borsalino3] \
\[LongDash] denominators,\\n    SPs[borsalino3] \[LongDash] scalar products \
involving loop momenta,\\n    LMs[borsalino3] \[LongDash] loop momenta,\\n    \
